{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/pulls/57784","id":4583787671,"node_id":"PR_kwDOI7xefs8AAAABETcMlw","html_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57784","diff_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57784.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/57784.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57784","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/pulls/57784/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/pulls/57784/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/issues/57784/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/statuses/c0ea625aa7e4bb01cee5b31972725cdfb7e9b3c7","number":57784,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[Feature] support bf16 MoE router and mxfp4 MoE for MiMo V2","user":{"login":"Zyann7","id":62597503,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTk3NTAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62597503?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zyann7","html_url":"https://github.com/Zyann7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zyann7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zyann7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zyann7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zyann7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zyann7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zyann7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zyann7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zyann7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zyann7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Purpose\r\n\r\nsupport serveral features for MiMo V2\r\n\r\n* mxfp4 MoE\r\n* bf16 MoE router\r\n* DFlash fo spec decoding\r\n\r\n## Serving\r\nMiMo V2 Pro:\r\n\r\n```\r\nvllm serve XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.5-Pro-DFlash \\\r\n  --trust-remote-code \\\r\n  --tensor-parallel-size 8 \\\r\n  --enable-expert-parallel \\\r\n  --distributed-executor-backend mp \\\r\n  --hf-overrides '{\"moe_router_dtype\":\"bfloat16\"}' \\\r\n  --moe-backend marlin \\\r\n  --gpu-memory-utilization 0.8 \\\r\n  --speculative-config '{\"method\":\"dflash\",\"model\":\" XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.5-Pro-DFlash/dflash\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":7,\"draft_tensor_parallel_size\":8}' \\\r\n  --served-model-name MiMo-V2.5-Pro-DFlash \\\r\n  --compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}' \\\r\n  --reasoning-parser mimo \\\r\n  --host 0.0.0.0 \\\r\n  --port 9001\r\n```\r\n\r\nMiMo V2 flash:\r\n\r\n```\r\nvllm serve XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.5-DFlash \\\r\n  --trust-remote-code \\\r\n  --tensor-parallel-size 4 \\\r\n  --enable-expert-parallel \\\r\n  --distributed-executor-backend mp \\\r\n  --hf-overrides '{\"moe_router_dtype\":\"bfloat16\"}' \\\r\n  --moe-backend marlin \\\r\n  --gpu-memory-utilization 0.8 \\\r\n  --speculative-config '{\"method\":\"dflash\",\"model\":\" XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.5-DFlash/dflash\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":7,\"draft_tensor_parallel_size\":4}' \\\r\n  --served-model-name MiMo-V2.5-DFlash \\\r\n  --compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\": \"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}' \\\r\n  --reasoning-parser mimo \\\r\n  --host 0.0.0.0 \\\r\n  --port 9001\r\n```\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":7197733874,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI7xefs8AAAABrQSz8g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/labels/ready","name":"ready","description":"ONLY add when PR is ready to merge/full CI is needed","color":"ededed","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8745996664,"node_id":"LA_kwDOI7xefs8AAAACCU1ReA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/labels/qwen","name":"qwen","description":"Related to Qwen models","color":"DBB0FE","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by